  "description": "One wedding, two heartbreaks. \n\nYu-Ri attends the wedding of his unrequited love. There, he runs into his former homeroom teacher Seon-Woo, who seems just as heartbroken by the union. But little does he know that Seon-Woo's tears are meant not for the bride, but for the groom... \n\n(Source: Manta) \n\n*Note: Includes 38 side story chapters and 17 epilogue chapters.*",
